Proposal algorithm for string connection for different DBMS under construction

# MySQL / MariaDB

## Template

user:pass@tcp(127.0.0.1:3306)/dbname?charset=utf8mb4&parseTime=True&loc=Local
username:password@protocol(address)/dbname?param=value

## algorithm

.*[:].*[@][tcp|udp]/.*

## Query parameters

|   Key| Value  |   |   |   |
|---|---|---|---|---|
|  charsets | any allowed value in MySQL spec  |   |   |   |
|  parseTime |  True/False |   |   |   |
|   loc | string  |   |   |   |

[For More info -And parameters-](http://github.com/go-sql-driver/mysql#parameters)


