# SQLite

## Template

file:DB_NAME

Example
```db
file:database.db
```
## Query parameters

|   Key| Value  |   |   |   |
|---|---|---|---|---|
|  cache | shared  |   |   |   |
|  mode |  memory |   |   |   |
|   |   |   |   |   |
```database
file:test.db?cache=shared&mode=memory
```

## Algorithm 

We're gonna provide an easy way of configuring the SQLite database. Just providing the file in the env path will enable this feature
```env
DATABASE_URL=database.db
```



